{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "原本（原）日本興聖寺所藏翻刻宋本。按此為唐僧惠昕所撰之本。晁公武郡齋讀書志及文獻通考並載之。但所載為三卷十六門。而此為兩卷十一門．實為惠昕原本。紹興時晁子健翻\n刻於蘄州。流傳日本。經興聖寺再行翻刻者。與燉煌本並為壇經古本。茲據日本森江書店鈴木貞太郎校訂本重刊。句讀勾乙及夾注校刊語。全依錄之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受原本作授。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吾原本作悟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖謂明曰。不思善。不思惡。正與麼時。如何是上座本來面目。明大悟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自原本作日。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適\n本。非上有亦字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適本。故下有言字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言有說當作有言說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乾下脫光字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世下脫人字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍復二字可疑。恐誤倒。持經人三字疑衍。若不然。人下當有脫文。胡適本。無倍復持經人五字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忘當作妄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適本無滅字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適本。念下有法字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適本。念下有法字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念字疑衍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適本。言作見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡適本。令作求。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著下脫我字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句有誤脫。胡適本。作理發者向道疾。外修者向道遲。可從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疸字可疑。恐疾之誤。下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須原本作次。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邪迷恐當\n作眾生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且原本作是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常原\n\n本作當。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三遍唱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世恐當作身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世恐當作身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "原本脫一葉凡四百六十二字。今依寬永辛未刊行本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通行本。作我本性元自清淨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "求通行本作本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若論相云云二十一字。通行本作若論相說。里數有十萬八千。即身中十惡八邪。便是說遠。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬原本作善。傳寫之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正法有十六字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拄原本作柱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅度年月附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若原本作含。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "汝通\n行本作如。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通行本。一上有說字。似是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後魏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通行本無切字。似勝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "及具王維碑銘。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0660a0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0660a0901", "type": "add", "text": "〔－〕【CB】，（一八）【佛教】"}
